Yeah, I like that reframing you and Sam talked

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:29.640
about with AI and being the one in

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:32.380
charge and using AI as an assistant versus a,

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:32.380
um,

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:35.140
uh, uh, uh, uh, being the assistant to the AI.

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:35.460
Um,

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:38.000
and then I think there's also a lot of specific

